ForeverDungeonTools
===================

ForeverDungeonTools is a modified version of MythicDungeonTools by Nnoggie.

Original project: https://github.com/Nnoggie/MythicDungeonTools
Original author: Nnoggie
License: GNU General Public License version 2 (see LICENSE)

This fork adapts MythicDungeonTools for World of Warcraft Classic Forever Beta
(dungeon planner with Classic / Forever dungeon list, Classic API safety, and
rebranded slash command /fdt). SavedVariables use FDTDB so retail MythicDungeonToolsDB
is not overwritten.

